{"pageid": 1440, "title": "Kiersten White", "revid": 2939, "categories": ["Crew"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Kiersten White</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d5/Kiersten_White.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260322010119\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Kiersten White\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d5/Kiersten_White.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260322010119\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d5/Kiersten_White.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260322010119 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d5/Kiersten_White.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260322010119 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Kiersten White\" width=\"270\" height=\"359\" data-image-key=\"Kiersten_White.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Kiersten White.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth_place\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Birth Place</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Utah, USA</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Birth Date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1983</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"role\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Role</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Author</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Kiersten White</b> is a 1 New York Times bestselling and Bram Stoker Award-winning author. She is co-writing <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children:_Hope_is_a_Knife\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children: Hope is a Knife\">Something Is Killing the Children: Hope is a Knife</a></i> alongside <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Biography\">Biography</span></h2>\n<p>White published her first book <i>Paranormalcy</i>, in 2010 with HarperCollins. Some of her other published works include <i>The House of Quiet</i>, the <i>And I Darken</i> trilogy, the <i>Sinister Summer</i> series, and the <i>Camelot Rising</i> trilogy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5f/Website.png/revision/latest?cb=20230223192639\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Website\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5f/Website.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192639\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Website.png\" data-image-key=\"Website.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.kierstenwhite.com/\">Kiersten White's official site</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://X.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://stat